# Vulnerabilities the CI image scan (Trivy) should not fail on.
#
# Only add an entry after checking that the vulnerability can't affect this service, or
# that no fix is possible yet and the risk is accepted. Every entry needs a comment with
# the reason and a date to review it again, and should be removed as soon as a fix is
# available. One vulnerability ID per line, for example:
#
#   # Only reachable through feature X, which we don't use. Review 2027-01-01.
#   CVE-2026-000000
